					<img alt="" src="images/Secure-Order-Process.png">
					<h4>
						<strong>Secure Order Process</strong>
					</h4>
					<p>Fill out our simple order form by selecting the authentication quick secure order process services you need and providing your details.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="info-box-home-page me-3">
					<img alt="" src="images/Complete-Your-Payment.png">
					<h4>
						<strong>Complete Your Payment</strong>
					</h4>
					<p>Easily submit your payment details and upload your documents for a quick review. Our secure process ensures fast processing, reliability, accuracy, and support.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="info-box-home-page">
					<img alt="" src="images/Receive-Documents-Easily.png">
					<h4>Receive Documents Easily</h4>
					<p>Sit back and relax while we handle everything. With our Quick Turnaround in 24 hours, you'll receive your authenticated documents without any hassle.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			
