	<section class="faq-section">
		<div class = "container">
		<h1 class = "text-center mb-5">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
		<div class="accordion">

			<div class="accordion-item">
				<div class="accordion-title">
					<span>What is an Apostille, and why do I need one?</span> <i
						class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
				</div>
				<div class="accordion-content">
					<p>An Apostille is an official certification that verifies the
						authenticity of a document for use in countries that are part of
						the Hague Convention. It is required for legal, educational,
						business, or personal documents when used internationally.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="accordion-item">
				<div class="accordion-title">
					<span>How long does it take to get an Apostille?</span> <i
						class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
				</div>
				<div class="accordion-content">
					<p>Our expedited Apostille service ensures quick processing.
						Depending on the document type and state, standard processing
						takes 5-10 business days, while rush services are available for
						even faster completion.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="accordion-item">
				<div class="accordion-title">
					<span>Which documents can you Apostille?</span> <i
						class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
				</div>
				<div class="accordion-content">
					<p>We handle Apostille services for birth certificates,
						marriage certificates, diplomas, transcripts, power of attorney,
						affidavits, notarized documents, business contracts, and more.
						Contact us to verify your document type.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="accordion-item">
				<div class="accordion-title">
					<span>Do you offer same-day Apostille services?</span> <i
						class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
				</div>
				<div class="accordion-content">
					<p>Yes, we provide expedited Apostille services, including
						same-day processing in select locations. Contact us to check
						availability and requirements for urgent requests.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="accordion-item">
				<div class="accordion-title">
					<span>How much does your Apostille service cost?</span> <i
						class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
				</div>
				<div class="accordion-content">
					<p>Our pricing varies based on the document type, state, and
						processing speed. Contact us for a detailed quote and to choose
						the best option that meets your needs.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="accordion-item">
				<div class="accordion-title">
					<span>How do I track the status of my Apostille request?</span> <i
						class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
				</div>
				<div class="accordion-content">
					<p>We keep you informed throughout the process. You will
						receive updates via email or phone, and you can also contact our
						support team for real-time tracking of your Apostille request.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

		</div>
